WEBVTT

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.460
LOST CAT

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.200
Lin.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:35.010
I'm positive. It's Lin's bell.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:19.190
Lin, come out.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.940
What is it?

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.150
I'm sorry.
I thought the house was vacant.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:50.720
I heard a bell. It sounded
just like my cat's bell.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:54.720
Oh, you are looking for your cat.
I haven't seen it.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.770
I'm so sorry.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:13.270
You seem so disappointed.
Your cat must have meant a lot to you.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:19.150
You must think it's silly that a grown
man is crying over a missing cat.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:23.050
I understand how you feel.
I love cats too.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.590
I would like one
if I could find a nice one.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:26.080
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:30.520
...and lead them to ruin.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:36.530
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.930
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:44.070
...in the human world.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:47.930
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:54.580
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.280
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:04.450
No one knows her true face.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.590
Second Grade Class C

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.390
Kashima. Sasaki.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:41.060
Shimazu.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:42.590
Shindoh.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.130
Suzuki.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.060
Sonoda.

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.760
Tanaka.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.870
Nagasawa.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.060
Hirano.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:53.770
Be quiet.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:55.770
No, no.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.440
Come on, keep quiet.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.550
You are the one who needs
to be quiet, aren't you, Chisato?

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.610
- What are you hiding?
- Wait, teacher!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.760
What in the world is it?

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:20.800
I petted her a little
and it followed me.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:27.670
Oh, she is so cute!
Where did you pick her up?

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.140
Let me see, let me see.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:34.240
Everyone gave me a really bad time.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:38.410
- What are you gonna do?
- You can't keep her at your house.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:43.520
If I brought her to school, I thought
I'd find someone who'd take her.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:47.490
I thought that was the case
so I asked around.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.260
Way to go, Hisae! So?

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.430
The result was negative. Too bad.

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.760
Take her back where you found her.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:06:01.370
That's too cruel! She is too little
to be left all by herself.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.370
Chisato, you are sweet.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.780
She's just simple-minded.

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:10.350
It might be a hopeless case
anyway, but...

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:13.120
A neighbor of ours is a cat lover.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:16.980
If he is a cat lover,
wouldn't he already have a cat?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:20.920
I heard that he recently lost
a cat he was really fond of.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:25.070
That's worse. He probably won't be
able to forget his first cat.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.030
It can't hurt to ask.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.500
If he's a real cat lover, he won't
be able to abandon this kitten.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.860
I understand how you feel.
I love cats too.

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:03.200
Excuse me, but I wanted to talk
to you about a cat.

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.770
Have you found Lin?

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.490
I'm sorry.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:31.360
She is really cute, but I can't
give up looking for Lin yet.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:40.330
- No, it was a bold idea on our part.
- Sorry to disturb you.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.540
I would like one
if I could find a nice one.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.920
Just a minute.
I may know someone who can help.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.770
LOST CAT

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.740
We've been walking around in circles.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:31.150
- Strange. It was here the other day.
- An old western-style house?

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:35.250
I've never heard of such
an eye-catching building around here.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.450
I swear it was here!
Do you believe me?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.690
We aren't doubting you,
but it's getting dark.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.030
If you wanna go home, go.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:47.830
I'll take the kitten.
I'll keep looking by myself.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.530
If he says so...

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.200
She'll take good care of the kitten?

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.840
You can trust her. Definitely.

00:10:00.050 --> 00:10:03.380
If I can't find her,
I'll take responsibility.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.780
Then we will leave it to you.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.180
I hope Lin is found.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:18.830
I'm glad the kitten will have
a new owner, but it was tiring.

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:20.970
- I don't like it.
- What?

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:25.760
That guy didn't seem to care
about his missing cat anymore.

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:28.340
That kitten may be mistreated.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:30.940
You're reading too much into it.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:35.050
He was a little weird,
but it didn't seem deliberate.

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:40.250
That kitten was friendly with Miyu.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:42.920
That's not true.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:47.460
Miyu, can't you keep her?
I'd feel much better if you kept her.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.000
- You give me too much credit.
- Chisato, it's too late.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.830
- I'll think about it.
- Thank you, Miyu!

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:04.540
- You're too lenient with Chisato.
- You'll be sorry when it's a habit.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:14.080
It's around here somewhere.
I really did see it.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.480
You liar!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.450
It's not a lie! I really did see it.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.890
I really did see it. Mother was...

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:33.230
Your mother was with a strange guy?
That is so ridiculous!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:38.740
What can I do?
I'm not his real mother.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.210
No! I'm...

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:45.350
Don't say another word!
I don't want to hear anymore!

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:50.150
Nobody believes what I say.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:13.510
Lin, I haven't forgotten about you.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:32.700
Finally, I found it.
Now I can see her again.

00:12:52.690 --> 00:12:56.820
I can smell a beast on you.
It's not a dog. It's a cat, right?

00:12:57.020 --> 00:13:00.020
If I wanted one,
would you help me care for it?

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.460
Absolutely not. An animal?

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.560
Miyu, you can't keep animals
just for fun.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:08.670
I know. But wouldn't it
be okay once in a while?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.900
Compared to us,
they live a short time.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:17.670
Never mind the kitten.
You have found some prey.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:38.300
She's not home. Too bad. It took me
so long to find this place.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:12.360
So many cats!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:38.020
It's you.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.570
I like her.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.920
What did you do?

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.790
Thank you for the cute kitten.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:25.000
If you want to know, follow me.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:58.870
Did that kitten die?
I thought you were a cat lover!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:04.330
Of course I love cats. Cats
have important nutrients we need.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.880
Here, look.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:18.650
Flowers?

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:22.990
The cats' spirits live in them.
Isn't it wonderful?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.630
They only bloom when
there's a full moon.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:31.700
If I take good care of them, they'll
never die and they'll keep me company.

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.500
Why?

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:41.200
I'm lonely by myself. I wanted
company. It's still a small group.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:45.220
But if I keep collecting nice cats...

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.180
...it will grow into a bigger group.

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:52.090
Darling, could you help me?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.760
Lin. Is that her?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:17:00.800
Was that her?
She was such a beautiful one.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.970
Lin! You're too cruel.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:08.340
Cruel?
A cat's life expectancy is limited.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:13.380
Wouldn't they be happier living
forever even in a different form?

00:17:14.310 --> 00:17:18.050
They don't wander away on their own.

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:23.250
No. It's better for them to wander
as long as they are free and happy.

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:27.090
That's too bad.
I thought you would understand.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:30.130
I didn't want to make too much noise.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.300
But cats aren't the only
plant food around here!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:43.500
It's not as easy as it is for cats.

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:53.510
SHINMA
KO-JYOH

00:17:55.890 --> 00:18:01.160
How would you like to become a flower?
I will take good care of you.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.870
Guardian?

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:21.510
Stop the mischief.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:45.430
Look what you've done! It took me
years to grow this many flowers.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.470
I wanted to take my mind
off my loneliness!

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:53.740
Can't you hear the cats' voices?
They don't like to be tied up.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.210
You are not well-liked.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.910
You don't understand!

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.390
Into the darkness, Shinma!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:49.330
Lin. I heard the bell.

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:54.270
Lin might have been trying
to let you know where she was.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:19:58.740
But I was attracted to that monster.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:02.750
I wanted to be with her.
I had forgotten about Lin.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.150
Only cats have not betrayed me.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:11.260
I had forgotten. I should have
been transformed into a flower too.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.430
Cats are the only ones you can love.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:17.960
Then I will let you
be with them always.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:41.890
Good morning, Miyu!
Did you think about it?

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:46.120
- What?
- Hey! Did you forget about the kitten?

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.660
Chisato, haven't you given up yet?

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:52.420
We already have a new owner.
Don't force her on Miyu.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:57.200
If Miyu can keep her,
I'll ask for her back. Well?

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:01.670
- I'm sorry.
- What? Come on!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:05.110
I'm sure Miyu has her reasons.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:08.540
I thought Miyu would be an ideal owner.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:12.880
Don't be disappointed.
Let's drop by and see how she's doing.

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:17.650
We've already left her with him.
It's not right to take her away.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:22.650
That's right. I agree.
I'm sure she is perfectly happy.

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:20.280
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:20.490 --> 00:22:22.820
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:26.960
...from so far away?

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:29.790
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.060
Who are you?

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:40.730
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:40.940 --> 00:22:45.570
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:45.780 --> 00:22:50.050
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:54.520
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:58.710
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:03.190
Washed away

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:10.000
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:14.440
Invited by the moon

00:23:14.640 --> 00:23:18.370
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:21.010 --> 00:23:27.540
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:34.720
The sky cries for me

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:47.930
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:50.470
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:50.680 --> 00:23:54.610
...from so far away?

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:57.440
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:23:57.650 --> 00:24:01.710
Who are you?

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:08.380
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:13.230
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:17.700
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:22.170
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:26.370
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:26.580 --> 00:24:30.850
Washed away

00:24:33.550 --> 00:24:37.650
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:37.860 --> 00:24:42.090
Invited by the moon

00:24:42.300 --> 00:24:46.030
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:55.200
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:55.440 --> 00:25:02.370
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.320 --> 00:25:09.760
Larva disappeared,
leaving behind mysterious words.

00:25:10.220 --> 00:25:15.390
I'm trying to follow him,
but a Shinma and Reiha get in my way.

00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:17.390
What is happening?

00:25:17.600 --> 00:25:21.190
Larva, have you forgotten
about your promise?

00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:25.360
The promise you made a long time ago.

00:25:25.870 --> 00:25:30.710
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Light of the Sea, Part 1."

00:25:30.910 --> 00:25:34.750
The sea is a place of promises.
